# Content-only mockups

This repository publishes static mockups, preview layouts, documentation, and illustrative content.

- Copy, preview layout, documentation, and illustrative-data changes do not require tests.
- Do not create, update, or execute tests by default.
- Do not alter existing tests unless the user explicitly requests test work.
- Inspect `package.json` before validation and avoid aggregate scripts that run tests.

Validate content-only work with:

- static build, typecheck, and lint commands that do not invoke tests;
- `git diff --check`;
- internal links, routes, and relevant anchors;
- browser console inspection;
- desktop and mobile visual review.

Before publication, verify dynamic placeholders, event timing, factual consistency, contradictory data, and editorial blockers. Illustrative data must remain clearly identified.
